    \"_redesign\": \"\U0001F534 V\xD2NG 18 \u2014 user ch\u1ED1t: 'dibu ch\u1EC9
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mua \u1EDF tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EA7u m\xF4n v\xE0 ch\u1EC9
    c\xF3 t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 \u0111\xE1nh ch\u1EBFt qu\xE1i b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 l\xE0 20/30/40.
    kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng kh\xE1c'. \u0110\xC3 G\u1EE0: cooldown 20s c\u1EE7a
    `can_pha`, aura ch\u1EADm 30% c\u1EE7a `ap_dao`, h\u1ED3i m\xE1u 1/3-c\u1EA3n
    c\u1EE7a `nguoi_hung_luan_luu`. GI\u1EDC: nh\u1ECBp 0.5 (1 l\u1EA7n th\u1EED
    m\u1ED7i 2s), m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n c\xF3 killChancePercent xo\xE1 s\u1ED5 qu\xE2n
    b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 K\u1EC2 C\u1EA2 BOSS. H\u1EC6 QU\u1EA2 T\u1ED0T: ngo\u1EA1i
    l\u1EC7 B-01 c\u1EE7a Dibu KH\xD4NG C\xD2N C\u1EA6N. Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xE2y
    c\u1EA3 3 c\u1EA5p ph\u1EA3i l\u1EB7p `blocksAtGoalLine` v\xEC c\u1EA3n b\xF3ng
    l\xE0 \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a c\u1EE7a v\u1ECB tr\xED th\u1EE7 m\xF4n \u2014
    gi\u1EDD m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p \u0111\xFAng M\u1ED8T k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, ch\u1EC9
    kh\xE1c %. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 B-01 s\u1EA1ch, kh\xF4ng ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7. Lu\u1EADt
    18 gi\u1EDD \xE1p cho C\u1EA2 6 t\u01B0\u1EDBng. H\u1EC6 QU\u1EA2 C\u1EA6N THEO
    D\xD5I: 0.5 \xD7 20% = 0.10 con/gi\xE2y \u1EDF Lv1, so v\u1EDBi can_pha c\u0169
    1 con/20s = 0.05 \u2014 m\u1EA1nh g\u1EA5p 2. Nh\u01B0ng Dibu m\u1EA5t h\u1EB3n
    aura l\xE0m ch\u1EADm (th\u1EE9 `docs/02` g\u1ECDi l\xE0 'k\xE9o d\xE0i th\u1EDDi
    gian m\u1ECDi t\u01B0\u1EDBng kh\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EAFn v\xE0o \u0111o\u1EA1n
    cu\u1ED1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng') v\xE0 m\u1EA5t ngu\u1ED3n h\u1ED3i m\xE1u duy
    nh\u1EA5t kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n ti\u1EC1n. balance_sim KH\xD4NG m\xF4 h\xECnh ho\xE1
    Dibu (damage 0 \u2192 kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m trong dps_towers), n\xEAn n\xF3 KH\xD4NG
    th\u1EA5y thay \u0111\u1ED5i n\xE0y. Ph\u1EA3i \u0111o \u1EDF M1. \U0001F534
    NG\u1EAAU NHI\xCAN: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 c\u01A1 ch\u1EBF RNG \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn
    trong game. C\xF9ng m\u1ED9t wave gi\u1EDD kh\xF3 d\u1EC5 kh\xE1c nhau m\u1ED7i
    l\u1EA7n ch\u01A1i.\",\n      \"_rangeFix\": \"\U0001F534 V\xD2NG 18 \u2014 BUG
