    L\xE0m ph\u1EB3ng h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa ([1.1,1.1,1.1]) th\xEC th\u1EE7ng S\xC0N
    1.05. V\u1EABn l\xE0 s\u1ED1 B\u1ECAA \u2014 ch\u1EC9 telemetry M1 \u0111o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.
    \u0110\u1EEBng t\u01B0\u1EDFng n\xF3 c\xF3 c\u0103n c\u1EE9 h\u01A1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.\",\n   
    \"tauByArbitroLevel\": [\n      1.0,\n      1.07,\n      1.2,\n      1.26\n   
    ],\n    \"_tauNote\": \"Index 0 = kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \xC1rbitro. Ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c
