    1.2,\n    \"_d10sNote\": \"Gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh. Qu\xE2n \u0111i H\xC0NG D\u1ECCC
    tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng, kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE9ng c\u1EE5m tr\xF2n \u2192
    s\u1ED1 th\u1EADt c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1EA7n 2. \u0110o \u1EDF M1.\",\n    \"_d10sAnchorNote\":
    \"`d10sAverageTargetsHit` KH\xD4NG ph\u1EA3i h\u1EB1ng s\u1ED1 ph\u1EB3ng \u2014
    n\xF3 l\xE0 'ch\u1EA1m 3 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu KHI b\xE1n k\xEDnh lan = 1.2'. balance_sim.py
    suy ra b\xE1n k\xEDnh kh\xE1c b\u1EB1ng t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 TUY\u1EBEN T\xCDNH (kh\xF4ng
    ph\u1EA3i r\xB2): qu\xE2n \u0111i h\xE0ng d\u1ECDc n\xEAn v\xF2ng tr\xF2n lan
    c\u1EAFt m\u1ED9t \u0111o\u1EA1n th\u1EB3ng \u2192 s\u1ED1 qu\xE2n ch\u1EA1m
    t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG K\xCDNH. C\u1EE5m tr\xF2n m\u1EDBi t\u1EC9
    l\u1EC7 di\u1EC7n t\xEDch. Neo ph\u1EA3i t\u01B0\u1EDDng minh v\xEC tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
    \u0111\xE2y s\u1ED1 3 \xE1p cho M\u1ECCI c\u1EA5p trong khi Lv1 lan 1.2 c\xF2n
    Lv2/Lv3 lan 1.7 \u2014 t\u1EF1 m\xE2u thu\u1EABn, v\xE0 kh\xF4ng ai ghi n\xF3
    hi\u1EC7u chu\u1EA9n cho b\xE1n k\xEDnh n\xE0o. B-01 l\xE0m l\u1ED9 ra (Lv2 lan
    1.7 \u2260 Lv3 lan 1.2). NEO \u1EDE 1.2 = gi\u1EEF nguy\xEAn hi\u1EC7u chu\u1EA9n
    Lv1 c\u0169, v\xE0 s\u1EEDa vi\u1EC7c m\xF4 h\xECnh c\u0169 \u0110\u1EBEM THI\u1EBEU
    Lv2. \u0110\xE3 th\u1EED neo \u1EDF 1.7: cho 20/20 wave \u0111\u1EA1t d\u1EA3i
    NH\u01AFNG bi\u1EBFn D10S th\xE0nh N\u1ED8I DUNG CH\u1EBET (0 wave mua n\xF3)
    v\xE0 gi\u1EBFt c\u01A1 ch\u1EBF boss (build \u0111\xE1m-\u0111\xF4ng W20 l\xEAn
    1.17 \u2192 boss kh\xF4ng \xE9p g\xEC). D\u1EA3i s\u1ED1 \u0111\u1EB9p kh\xF4ng
    \u0111\xE1ng \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EB1ng m\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng tier S ch\u1EBFt
    \u2014 v\xF2ng 5 \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc b\xE0i n\xE0y v\u1EDBi El Fideo.\",\n   
    \"assumeChordEquals2R\": false,\n    \"_chordWarning\": \"\u2705 GI\u1EA2I XONG
    (v\xF2ng 5). Gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh n\xE0y KH\xD4NG C\xD2N \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C
    D\xD9NG: tools/balance_sim.py \u0111o chord TH\u1EACT b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch l\u1EA5y
    4000 m\u1EABu spline path.json v\xE0 t\xEDnh \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    n\u1EB1m trong v\xF2ng tr\xF2n t\u1EA7m c\u1EE7a T\u1EEANG \xF4. Kh\xF4ng c\xF2n
    x\u1EA5p x\u1EC9. N\xE9n t\u1EA7m v\u1EC1 \u22642.0 c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0a chord/2R
    trung b\xECnh v\u1EC1 0.96, n\xEAn k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 ai t\xEDnh tay b\u1EB1ng 2R
    c\u0169ng ch\u1EC9 l\u1EC7ch ~4%.\",\n    \"_chordRootCause\": \"G\u1ED1c l\xE0
    T\u1EA6M QU\xC1 L\u1EDAN so v\u1EDBi b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3. \u0110\xE3 s\u1EEDa
    2 l\u1EA7n \u1EDF v\xF2ng 5: 3.0-7.0 \u2192 1.1-2.6 (h\xE0nh lang 118% \u2192
