    0.80) nh\u01B0ng boss GI\u1EEEA W10 th\xE0nh trung t\xEDnh (\u0111\xE1m-\u0111\xF4ng
    1.03 ngay \u1EDF base g\u1ED1c \u2014 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE0i l\xE0m D10S
    ph\u1EE7 kh\xE1c, build \u0111\xE1m-\u0111\xF4ng s\u1ED1ng W10). G\u1EE0 lu\u1EADt
    RADIAL MENU trong path_check: UI \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF radial (Hud d\xF9ng thanh
    bottom) n\xEAn \xF4 s\xE1t m\xE9p tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0m n\xFAt b\u1ECB
    c\u1EAFt. Dibu gi\u1EEF t\u1EA7m [1.2,1.4,1.6] v\xE0 gk gi\u1EEF ki\u1EC3u xa
    c\u1EA7u m\xF4n (user ch\u1ED1t). \U0001F534 V\xD2NG 22 \u2014 G\u1EE0 EL FIDEO
    (user ch\u1ED1t 2026-08-20, 'kh\xF4ng s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng n\u1EEFa'). M\u1ECDi
