    \u0110o l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng path_check sau khi g\u1EE1: El Cinco 7/11 \xB7 D10S
    8/11 \xB7 \xC1rbitro 8/11 \xB7 La Pulga 11/11 \u2014 0 \xD4 CH\u1EBET, v\xEC
