    l\xE0 \xF4 \u0110\u1ED8C QUY\u1EC0N El Fideo' kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u0111\xFAng. C\xE2n
    b\u1EB1ng KH\xD4NG \u0111\u1EE5ng theo y\xEAu c\u1EA7u user: balance_sim \u0111o
