    order: 0
    json: "{\n  \"id\": \"m00\",\n  \"displayName\": \"La Muralla\",\n  \"order\":
      0,\n  \"difficulty\": 1,\n  \"_mapNote\": \"\U0001F535 2026-08-21 \u2014 file
      n\xE0y TR\u01AF\u1EDAC \u0110\xC2Y l\xE0 `config/path.json`. \u0110\u1ED5i
      ch\u1ED7 v\xEC game gi\u1EDD c\xF3 nhi\u1EC1u map. m00 KH\xD4NG khai `waves`/`economy`/`bossOverrides`,
      n\xEAn n\xF3 d\xF9ng nguy\xEAn `config/waves.json` v\xE0 `config/economy.json`
      d\xF9ng chung \u2014 t\u1EE9c c\xE2n b\u1EB1ng c\u1EE7a n\xF3 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED5i
      m\u1ED9t ch\u1EEF s\u1ED1 n\xE0o so v\u1EDBi tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. Map kh\xE1c ghi
      \u0111\xE8 b\u1EB1ng c\xE1c kh\u1ED1i \u0111\xF3. Xem docs/08-MAPS-ARCHITECTURE.md
      \xA72.\",\n  \"_comment\": \"\u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG CH\u1EA0Y + \xD4 \u0110\u1EB6T
      T\u01AF\u1EDANG. File n\xE0y TR\u01AF\u1EDAC \u0110\xC2Y KH\xD4NG T\u1ED2N
      T\u1EA0I \u2014 PathFollower \u1EDF docs/05 \xA73 n\xF3i '\u0111i theo spline
      c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh' nh\u01B0ng spline kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u
      c\u1EA3.\",\n  \"_status\": \"\u2705 TO\u1EA0 \u0110\u1ED8 TH\u1EACT, \u0111\xE3
      \u0111o b\u1EB1ng tools/path_check.py (v\xF2ng 5). M\u1ECDi r\xE0ng bu\u1ED9c
      h\xECnh h\u1ECDc \u0110\u1EA0T: spline 40.65 vs khai 40 = l\u1EC7ch 1.6% \xB7
      h\u1ED9p bao trong viewport \xB7 0 \xF4 ch\u1EBFt \xB7 thang t\u1EA7m 4 b\u1EADc
      th\u1EADt.\",\n  \"_slotDesign\": \"11 \xF4 r\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC1u theo QU\xC3NG
      \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG (f=0.06\u21920.95). M\u1ED7i \xF4 \u1EDF m\u1ED9t T\u1EA6NG
      kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch c\u1ED1 \xFD, \u0103n kh\u1EDBp thang t\u1EA7m Lv1: Batigol
      7/11 \xB7 D10S 8/11 \xB7 \xC1rbitro 8/11 \xB7 La Pulga 8/11 \xB7 El Fideo 11/11.
      \U0001F534 V\xD2NG 17 \u2014 N\xC2NG S\xC0N. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EED
      m\xE1y th\u1EADt b\xE1o BA L\u1EA6N 't\u01B0\u1EDBng kh\xF4ng g\xE2y dame';
      c\u1EA3 ba \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 \xF4 ngo\xE0i t\u1EA7m. Batigol ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c 5/11 = 45%, qu\xE1 ng\u1EB7t. K\xE9o \u0110\xDANG HAI \xF4
      f02 (d 1.31\u21920.88) v\xE0 f08 (1.30\u21920.88), GI\u1EEE NGUY\xCAN v\u1ECB
      tr\xED theo qu\xE3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng f n\xEAn ph\xE2n b\u1ED1 d\u1ECDc
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED5i. C\xE2n b\u1EB1ng v\u1EABn 0/20
      wave v\u1EE1 d\u1EA3i [1.05,1.65] (min 1.06 \xB7 tb 1.38 \xB7 max 1.56) v\xE0
      KH\xD4NG ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EE5ng hpScaling hay \u03C3. \u0110\xC3 TH\u1EEC
      V\xC0 B\u1ECE: k\xE9o th\xEAm f06 (1.50\u21921.12) v\xE0 f09 (1.50\u21921.32)
      cho Batigol 7 / D10S 9 / \xC1rbitro 9 / Pulga 10 \u2014 nh\u01B0ng chord t\u0103ng
      \u1EDF qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u \xF4 l\xE0m 3/20 wave v\u1EE1 d\u1EA3i (max 1.69),
      v\xE0 KH\xD4NG c\u1EA5u h\xECnh hpScaling n\xE0o c\u1EE9u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      (qu\xE9t base 0.69-0.79 \xD7 growth 1.085-1.095: t\u1ED1t nh\u1EA5t v\u1EABn
      1 wave th\u1EE7ng S\xC0N). \u03C3 c\u0169ng v\xF4 \xEDch \u2014 n\xF3 d\u1ECBch
      d\u1EA3i ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng n\xE9n. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc: k\xE9o \xF4 l\xE0 \u0111\xF2n
      b\u1EA9y M\u1EA0NH, d\xF9ng \xEDt th\xF4i. KH\xD4NG t\u0103ng t\u1EA7m: v\xF2ng
      5 \u0111\xE3 thu t\u1EA7m \xD70.36 v\xEC chord SI\xCAU TUY\u1EBEN T\xCDNH (t\u1EA7m
      \xD72.4 \u2192 chord \xD75.3) l\xE0m El Fideo th\u1ED1ng tr\u1ECB v\xE0 2/5
      t\u01B0\u1EDBng th\xE0nh n\u1ED9i dung ch\u1EBFt. f03/f06/f09 (d\u22481.5)
      GI\u1EEE NGUY\xCAN l\xE0m \xF4 \u0110\u1ED8C QUY\u1EC0N El Fideo \u2014 thang
      ph\u1EA3i c\xF2n \u0111\u1EC9nh. M\u1ECDi d c\xE1ch m\xE9p t\u1EA7m \u22650.12:
      nh\u1EAFm 0.95 s\xE1t t\u1EA7m 1.0 b\u1ECB lu\u1EADt RANH GI\u1EDAI DAO C\u1EA0O
      ch\u1EB7n (l\u1EC7ch 0.05 unit = 1.8pt, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EA5y
