      \"_bossNote\": \"HP m\u1ED7i boss t\u0103ng qua W5/W10/W15/W20; W15/W20 c\xF3
      hai boss n\xEAn ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EA5m theo t\u1ED5ng HP encounter.\",\n  \"hpScaling\":
      {\n    \"base\": 0.67,\n    \"growthPerWave\": 1.12\n  },\n  \"_hpScalingNote\":
      \"\U0001F534 growth RI\xCANG cho map n\xE0y, cao h\u01A1n 1.09 d\xF9ng chung.
      L\xFD do \u0110O \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C: h\xECnh h\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a map l\xE0m
      \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG T\u1EF0 \xC1P S\xC1T CH\xCDNH N\xD3, n\xEAn m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng
      t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nhi\u1EC1u kh\xFAc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      r\u1EDDi nhau \u2014 'm\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\xE1nh hai l\u01B0\u1EE3t'.
      \u0110o \u1EDF t\u1EA7m 1.4: s\u1EE9c ph\xF2ng ng\u1EF1 tr\xEAn m\u1ED7i \xF4
      l\xE0 2.90 so v\u1EDBi 1.74 c\u1EE7a m00 (\xD71.67). Kh\xF4ng b\xF9 th\xEC
      map c\xE0ng 'h\xECnh h\u1ECDc th\xFA v\u1ECB' l\u1EA1i c\xE0ng D\u1EC4, v\xE0
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 b\xE1o \u0111\xFAng hi\u1EC7n
      t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\xF3: b\u1ED1n map \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF3
      GI\u1EA2M d\u1EA7n. Gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB ch\u1ECDn b\u1EB1ng qu\xE9t engine \u2014
      \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1EE9c cao nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 b\xE0i ki\u1EC3m 20 wave v\u1EABn
      TH\u1EAENG (xem MapPlayableTests). \u26A0\uFE0F Bot trong b\xE0i ki\u1EC3m
      khai th\xE1c h\xECnh h\u1ECDc K\xC9M H\u01A0N ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EADt,
      n\xEAn n\xF3 l\xE0 S\xC0N ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA7n: n\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ch\u01A1i v\u1EABn th\u1EA5y d\u1EC5 th\xEC n\xFAm ti\u1EBFp theo l\xE0 S\u1EECA
      \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG \u0110I cho b\u1EDBt t\u1EF1 \xE1p s\xE1t, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      t\u0103ng m\xE1u n\u1EEFa.\",\n  \"coveragePerSlot\": 2.9,\n  \"_coverageNote\":
      \"\U0001F534 S\u1EE8C PH\xD2NG NG\u1EF0 TR\xCAN M\u1ED6I \xD4 \u2014 t\u1ED5ng
      \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\u1EB1m trong t\u1EA7m tham chi\u1EBFu,
      chia s\u1ED1 \xF4 s\xE2n. \u0110o b\u1EB1ng `tools/path_check.py --map m02`;
      l\u1EC7ch qu\xE1 8% so v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1 n\xE0y l\xE0 \u0110\u1ECE. V\xEC sao
      ph\u1EA3i KHAI thay v\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n sau: h\xECnh h\u1ECDc
      'th\xFA v\u1ECB' (zigzag, t\xFAi combo, xo\xE1y \u1ED1c) l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      T\u1EF0 \xC1P S\xC1T CH\xCDNH N\xD3 \u2192 m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt
      nhi\u1EC1u kh\xFAc r\u1EDDi nhau \u2192 m\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\xE1nh
      nhi\u1EC1u l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u2192 map c\xE0ng th\xFA v\u1ECB c\xE0ng D\u1EC4.
      Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 b\xE1o \u0111\xFAng hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      \u0111\xF3: b\u1ED1n map \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF3 GI\u1EA2M d\u1EA7n.
      C\xF3 khai b\xE1o th\xEC s\u1EEDa waypoint m\xE0 v\xF4 t\xECnh l\xE0m map d\u1EC5
      \u0111i s\u1EBD bi\u1EBFt NGAY. \u26A0\uFE0F \u0110\u1ED5i s\u1ED1 n\xE0y th\xEC
      PH\u1EA2I xem l\u1EA1i `hpScaling.growthPerWave` \u2014 hai th\u1EE9 b\xF9
      nhau. M\u1ED1c so s\xE1nh: m00 = 1.74 (\u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1
      \xE1p s\xE1t, m\u1ED7i v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt \u0111\xFAng 1 kh\xFAc).\",\n 
      \"goalkeeperMinLeadUnits\": 1.0,\n  \"goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits\": 2.0,\n 
      \"_goalkeeperPlacementNote\": \"\xD4 Dibu ph\u1EA3i canh m\u1ED9t \u0111o\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE0i \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits v\xE0
      to\xE0n b\u1ED9 \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\xF3 ph\u1EA3i n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\u1ED1i ra \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinLeadUnits. Hai ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      tools/path_check.py --check thi h\xE0nh; kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xE9o
      \xF4 v\u1EC1 s\xE1t c\u1EA7u m\xF4n ch\u1EC9 v\xEC nh\xECn gi\u1ED1ng v\u1ECB
      tr\xED th\u1EE7 m\xF4n.\"\n}\n"
