      hai ph\xEDa. Hai nh\xE1nh h\u1EE3p l\u01B0u \u1EDF gi\u1EEFa s\xE2n r\u1ED3i
      d\xF9ng chung m\u1ED9t l\u1ED1i ra. HUD C\u1EECA cho ph\xE9p chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc thay v\xEC \u0111o\xE1n ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn.\",\n  \"coveragePerSlot\":
      3.3,\n  \"_coverageNote\": \"\U0001F534 S\u1EE9c ph\xF2ng ng\u1EF1 tr\xEAn
      m\u1ED7i \xF4, \u0110O b\u1EB1ng tools/path_check.py; l\u1EC7ch >8% l\xE0 \u0111\u1ECF.
      V\u1EDBi map \u0111a tuy\u1EBFn con s\u1ED1 n\xE0y g\u1ED3m c\u1EA3 \xF4 canh
      \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C NHI\u1EC0U TUY\u1EBEN \u2014 \u0111\xF3 ch\xEDnh l\xE0
