      \"_bossNote\": \"HP m\u1ED7i boss t\u0103ng qua W5/W10/W15/W20; W15/W20 c\xF3
      hai boss n\xEAn ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EA5m theo t\u1ED5ng HP encounter.\",\n  \"_maxGapNote\":
      \"\U0001F534 N\u1EDAI 0.15 \u2192 0.165, C\xD3 \u0110O ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng n\u1EDBi
      cho qua. D\xF2 TO\xC0N B\u1ED8 v\u1ECB tr\xED kh\u1EA3 d\u0129 cho \xF4 y\u1EBFu
      nh\u1EA5t cho th\u1EA5y 9 \xF4 tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng 52.18u KH\xD4NG
      TH\u1EC2 \u0111\u1EA1t 15% \u2014 t\u1ED1i \u01B0u tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i
      l\xE0 16.3%. Nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n l\xE0 ph\xE9p \u0111o, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i map:
      path_check g\xE1n m\u1ED7i \xF4 v\xE0o M\u1ED8T \u0111i\u1EC3m g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t,
      m\xE0 xo\xE1y \u1ED1c th\xEC m\u1ED9t \xF4 canh hai \u0111o\u1EA1n f r\u1EA5t
      xa nhau, n\xEAn 'kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c \xF4 d\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng'
      b\u1ECB th\u1ED5i ph\u1ED3ng. \U0001F535 f07 \u0111\xE3 D\u1EDCI (-3.70,-4.40)
      \u2192 (-0.60,-8.70) \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EA1m \u0111\xFAng t\u1ED1i \u01B0u \u0111\xF3.
      \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111\xE1nh \u0111\u1ED5i \u0110O \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C, kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m \u0111\u1EB9p s\u1ED1: ph\u1EE7 \u1EDF R=1.0 t\u0103ng 11.1%
      \u2192 16.5% (\u0111\xFAng ch\u1ED7 th\u1EE7ng \u2014 \u0111\u1EA7u tr\u1EADn,
      t\u01B0\u1EDBng Lv1), \u0111\u1ED5i l\u1EA1i ph\u1EE7 \u1EDF R=1.8 gi\u1EA3m
      73.0% \u2192 69.8%. Ch\u1ECDn v\xEC l\u1ED7 h\u1ED5ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u
      tr\u1EADn, cu\u1ED1i tr\u1EADn v\u1ED1n \u0111\xE3 \u1ED5n. \u26A0\uFE0F N\u1EBFu
      test 20-wave cho th\u1EA5y kh\xF4ng qua n\u1ED5i \u0111\u1EA7u tr\u1EADn th\xEC
      ph\u1EA3i R\xDAT NG\u1EAEN xo\xE1y \u1ED1c, KH\xD4NG n\u1EDBi th\xEAm. \U0001F535
      y ban \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1EB7t -9.00 th\xEC v\xF9ng ch\u1EA1m 48pt TR\xC0N
      m\xE9p d\u01B0\u1EDBi 0.06u \u2014 path_check b\u1EAFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.
      N\xE2ng l\xEAn -8.70: v\u1EABn gi\u1EEF nguy\xEAn khe 16.3% m\xE0 ph\u1EE7
      R=1.0 c\xF2n t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n (16.5%).\",\n  \"hpScaling\": {\n    \"base\":
      0.67,\n    \"growthPerWave\": 1.12\n  },\n  \"_hpScalingNote\": \"\U0001F534
      growth RI\xCANG cho map n\xE0y, cao h\u01A1n 1.09 d\xF9ng chung. L\xFD do \u0110O
      \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C: h\xECnh h\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a map l\xE0m \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG
      T\u1EF0 \xC1P S\xC1T CH\xCDNH N\xD3, n\xEAn m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nhi\u1EC1u kh\xFAc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng r\u1EDDi nhau \u2014
      'm\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\xE1nh hai l\u01B0\u1EE3t'. \u0110o \u1EDF
      t\u1EA7m 1.4: s\u1EE9c ph\xF2ng ng\u1EF1 tr\xEAn m\u1ED7i \xF4 l\xE0 3.03 so
      v\u1EDBi 1.74 c\u1EE7a m00 (\xD71.74). Kh\xF4ng b\xF9 th\xEC map c\xE0ng 'h\xECnh
      h\u1ECDc th\xFA v\u1ECB' l\u1EA1i c\xE0ng D\u1EC4, v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i
      th\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 b\xE1o \u0111\xFAng hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\xF3:
      b\u1ED1n map \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF3 GI\u1EA2M d\u1EA7n. Gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB
      ch\u1ECDn b\u1EB1ng qu\xE9t engine \u2014 \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1EE9c cao nh\u1EA5t
      m\xE0 b\xE0i ki\u1EC3m 20 wave v\u1EABn TH\u1EAENG (xem MapPlayableTests).
      \u26A0\uFE0F Bot trong b\xE0i ki\u1EC3m khai th\xE1c h\xECnh h\u1ECDc K\xC9M
      H\u01A0N ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i th\u1EADt, n\xEAn n\xF3 l\xE0 S\xC0N ch\u1EE9
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA7n: n\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i v\u1EABn th\u1EA5y
      d\u1EC5 th\xEC n\xFAm ti\u1EBFp theo l\xE0 S\u1EECA \u0110\u01AF\u1EDCNG \u0110I
      cho b\u1EDBt t\u1EF1 \xE1p s\xE1t, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i t\u0103ng m\xE1u n\u1EEFa.\",\n 
      \"coveragePerSlot\": 2.63,\n  \"_coverageNote\": \"\U0001F534 S\u1EE8C PH\xD2NG
      NG\u1EF0 TR\xCAN M\u1ED6I \xD4 \u2014 t\u1ED5ng \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      n\u1EB1m trong t\u1EA7m tham chi\u1EBFu, chia s\u1ED1 \xF4 s\xE2n. \u0110o
      b\u1EB1ng `tools/path_check.py --map m06`; l\u1EC7ch qu\xE1 8% so v\u1EDBi
      s\u1ED1 n\xE0y l\xE0 \u0110\u1ECE. V\xEC sao ph\u1EA3i KHAI thay v\xEC \u0111\u1EC3
      ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n sau: h\xECnh h\u1ECDc 'th\xFA v\u1ECB' (zigzag, t\xFAi combo,
      xo\xE1y \u1ED1c) l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng T\u1EF0 \xC1P S\xC1T CH\xCDNH
      N\xD3 \u2192 m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt nhi\u1EC1u kh\xFAc r\u1EDDi
      nhau \u2192 m\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\xE1nh nhi\u1EC1u l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      \u2192 map c\xE0ng th\xFA v\u1ECB c\xE0ng D\u1EC4. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i
      \u0111\xE3 b\xE1o \u0111\xFAng hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\xF3: b\u1ED1n
      map \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF3 GI\u1EA2M d\u1EA7n. C\xF3 khai b\xE1o
      th\xEC s\u1EEDa waypoint m\xE0 v\xF4 t\xECnh l\xE0m map d\u1EC5 \u0111i s\u1EBD
      bi\u1EBFt NGAY. \u26A0\uFE0F \u0110\u1ED5i s\u1ED1 n\xE0y th\xEC PH\u1EA2I
      xem l\u1EA1i `hpScaling.growthPerWave` \u2014 hai th\u1EE9 b\xF9 nhau. M\u1ED1c
      so s\xE1nh: m00 = 1.74 (\u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 \xE1p s\xE1t,
      m\u1ED7i v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m c\u1EAFt \u0111\xFAng 1 kh\xFAc).\",\n  \"_balanceNote\":
      \"V\xF2ng 27b.\",\n  \"goalkeeperMinLeadUnits\": 1.0,\n  \"goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits\":
      2.0,\n  \"_goalkeeperPlacementNote\": \"\xD4 Dibu ph\u1EA3i canh m\u1ED9t \u0111o\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE0i \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits v\xE0
      to\xE0n b\u1ED9 \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\xF3 ph\u1EA3i n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\u1ED1i ra \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinLeadUnits. Hai ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      tools/path_check.py --check thi h\xE0nh; kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xE9o
      \xF4 v\u1EC1 s\xE1t c\u1EA7u m\xF4n ch\u1EC9 v\xEC nh\xECn gi\u1ED1ng v\u1ECB
      tr\xED th\u1EE7 m\xF4n.\"\n}\n"
