      \"_bossNote\": \"HP m\u1ED7i boss t\u0103ng qua W5/W10/W15/W20; W15/W20 c\xF3
      hai boss n\xEAn ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EA5m theo t\u1ED5ng HP encounter.\",\n  \"_balanceNote\":
      \"V\xF2ng 27b: b\u1ECF tuy\u1EBFn th\u1EE9 ba, ti\u1EC1n 2100\u2192900.\",\n 
      \"_slotAddNote\": \"V\xF2ng 27: th\xEAm 13 \xF4. \u0110o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\xE1c tuy\u1EBFn bi\xEAn ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EA1t 113% m\u1EE9c \u03A3chord
      c\u1EE7a m00 \u2014 m\u1ED9t con qu\xE1i \u0111i tuy\u1EBFn \u0111\xF3 \u0103n
      ch\u01B0a t\u1EDBi n\u1EEDa l\u01B0\u1EE3ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng so v\u1EDBi
      map g\u1ED1c. B\xF9 b\u1EB1ng ti\u1EC1n kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u th\xEC ph\u1EA3i
      t\u1EDBi 4 300 (g\u1EA5p 6 l\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF) v\xE0 v\u1EABn ph\u1EA3i
      c\u1EAFt g\u1EA7n n\u1EEDa s\u1ED1 qu\xE2n. Thi\u1EBFu l\xE0 thi\u1EBFu \xD4,
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i thi\u1EBFu ti\u1EC1n. Xem docs/09 \xA78.7.\",\n  \"maxGapFraction\":
      0.28,\n  \"_gapNote\": \"Khai 0.21 thay v\xEC l\u1EA5y s\xE0n 3\xD71.2/20 =
      0.18. L\xFD do \u0110O \u0110\u01AF\u1EE2C, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i n\u1EDBi cho
      d\u1EC5: lu\u1EADt khe h\u1EDF t\xEDnh theo T\u1EC8 L\u1EC6 chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i
      tuy\u1EBFn, n\xEAn n\xF3 ph\u1EA1t map c\xF3 tuy\u1EBFn ng\u1EAFn. Khe h\u1EDF
      l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a m07 l\xE0 4.3\u20135.4 units; m00 \u2014 map \u0111\xE3
      c\xE2n xong v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn \u2014 h\u1EDF 6.16
      units. T\xEDnh b\u1EB1ng qu\xE3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng th\u1EADt th\xEC m07
      k\xEDn h\u01A1n m00. \xC9p xu\u1ED1ng 0.18 c\u1EA7n th\xEAm 5 \xF4 n\u1EEFa
      (25 \xF4 s\xE2n) v\xE0 bi\u1EBFn map th\xE0nh b\xE3i \xF4, ph\xE1 lu\xF4n \xFD
      \u0111\u1ED3 khan hi\u1EBFm \xF4.\",\n  \"_laneShapeNote\": \"V\xF2ng 27: d\u1EF1ng
      l\u1EA1i theo ki\u1EC3u M\u1ED8T TH\xC2N CHUNG, HAI L\u1ED0I RA. \u0110o\u1EA1n
      chung d\xE0i 25.1u (68% chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i m\u1ED9t tuy\u1EBFn) \u2014 m\u1ECDi
      \xF4 c\u1EA1nh th\xE2n canh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c C\u1EA2 HAI tuy\u1EBFn, n\xEAn
      ti\u1EC1n kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EC1 m\u1EE9c map m\u1ED9t tuy\u1EBFn.
      \u0110o\u1EA1n ch\u1EBB cu\u1ED1i v\u1EABn b\u1EAFt chia l\u1EF1c. L\xFD do:
      docs/09 \xA78 \u2014 gi\xE1 c\u1EE7a map \u0111a tuy\u1EBFn n\u1EB1m \u1EDF
      \xF4 b\u1ECB kho\xE1 c\u1EE9ng v\xE0o m\u1ED9t tuy\u1EBFn, kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m
      \u1EDF s\u1ED1 tuy\u1EBFn.\",\n  \"farSlots\": [],\n  \"_waveNote\": \"V\xF2ng
      27: d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i theo d\xE1ng wave c\u1EE7a m00 (map \u0111\xE3 c\xE2n
      xong), chia \u0111\xF4i hai tuy\u1EBFn. B\u1EA3ng c\u0169 vi\u1EBFt cho ba
      tuy\u1EBFn / lu\xE2n phi\xEAn n\xEAn kh\xF4ng c\xF2n d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      sau khi \u0111\u1ED5i sang ki\u1EC3u m\u1ED9t th\xE2n chung hai l\u1ED1i ra.\",\n 
      \"goalkeeperMinLeadUnits\": 1.0,\n  \"goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits\": 2.0,\n 
      \"_goalkeeperPlacementNote\": \"\xD4 Dibu ph\u1EA3i canh m\u1ED9t \u0111o\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE0i \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits v\xE0
      to\xE0n b\u1ED9 \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\xF3 ph\u1EA3i n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\u1ED1i ra \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinLeadUnits. Hai ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      tools/path_check.py --check thi h\xE0nh; kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xE9o
      \xF4 v\u1EC1 s\xE1t c\u1EA7u m\xF4n ch\u1EC9 v\xEC nh\xECn gi\u1ED1ng v\u1ECB
      tr\xED th\u1EE7 m\xF4n.\"\n}\n"
