      \"farSlots\": [],\n  \"_farSlotsNote\": \"\xD4 C\u1ED0 \xDD n\u1EB1m ngo\xE0i
      t\u1EA7m Lv1 \u2014 c\u01A1 ch\u1EBF '\xE9p n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi tr\u1EA3i r\u1ED9ng'. Ph\u1EA3i khai \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y th\xEC path_check
      m\u1EDBi cho qua; kh\xF4ng khai th\xEC n\xF3 b\xE1o \xF4 ch\u1EBFt, v\xE0 \u0111\xFAng
      l\xE0 n\xEAn b\xE1o: \xF4 ngo\xE0i t\u1EA7m m\xE0 kh\xF4ng ai bi\u1EBFt l\xE0
      ti\u1EC1n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i n\xE9m \u0111i.\",\n  \"_balanceNote\":
      \"V\xF2ng 27b: b\u1ECF tuy\u1EBFn th\u1EE9 ba, ti\u1EC1n 4100\u2192900.\",\n 
      \"_slotAddNote\": \"V\xF2ng 27: th\xEAm 13 \xF4. \u0110o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\xE1c tuy\u1EBFn bi\xEAn ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EA1t 115% m\u1EE9c \u03A3chord
      c\u1EE7a m00 \u2014 m\u1ED9t con qu\xE1i \u0111i tuy\u1EBFn \u0111\xF3 \u0103n
      ch\u01B0a t\u1EDBi n\u1EEDa l\u01B0\u1EE3ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng so v\u1EDBi
      map g\u1ED1c. B\xF9 b\u1EB1ng ti\u1EC1n kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u th\xEC ph\u1EA3i
      t\u1EDBi 4 300 (g\u1EA5p 6 l\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF) v\xE0 v\u1EABn ph\u1EA3i
      c\u1EAFt g\u1EA7n n\u1EEDa s\u1ED1 qu\xE2n. Thi\u1EBFu l\xE0 thi\u1EBFu \xD4,
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i thi\u1EBFu ti\u1EC1n. Xem docs/09 \xA78.7.\",\n  \"_laneShapeNote\":
      \"V\xF2ng 27: d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i theo ki\u1EC3u M\u1ED8T TH\xC2N CHUNG, HAI
      L\u1ED0I RA. \u0110o\u1EA1n chung d\xE0i 24.3u (67% chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i m\u1ED9t
      tuy\u1EBFn) \u2014 m\u1ECDi \xF4 c\u1EA1nh th\xE2n canh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      C\u1EA2 HAI tuy\u1EBFn, n\xEAn ti\u1EC1n kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EC1 m\u1EE9c
      map m\u1ED9t tuy\u1EBFn. \u0110o\u1EA1n ch\u1EBB cu\u1ED1i v\u1EABn b\u1EAFt
      chia l\u1EF1c. L\xFD do: docs/09 \xA78 \u2014 gi\xE1 c\u1EE7a map \u0111a tuy\u1EBFn
      n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \xF4 b\u1ECB kho\xE1 c\u1EE9ng v\xE0o m\u1ED9t tuy\u1EBFn,
      kh\xF4ng n\u1EB1m \u1EDF s\u1ED1 tuy\u1EBFn.\",\n  \"_waveNote\": \"V\xF2ng
      27: d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i theo d\xE1ng wave c\u1EE7a m00 (map \u0111\xE3 c\xE2n
      xong), chia \u0111\xF4i hai tuy\u1EBFn. B\u1EA3ng c\u0169 vi\u1EBFt cho ba
      tuy\u1EBFn / lu\xE2n phi\xEAn n\xEAn kh\xF4ng c\xF2n d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      sau khi \u0111\u1ED5i sang ki\u1EC3u m\u1ED9t th\xE2n chung hai l\u1ED1i ra.\",\n 
      \"maxGapFraction\": 0.28,\n  \"goalkeeperMinLeadUnits\": 0.6,\n  \"goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits\":
      2.0,\n  \"_goalkeeperPlacementNote\": \"\xD4 Dibu ph\u1EA3i canh m\u1ED9t \u0111o\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE0i \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinCoverageUnits v\xE0
      to\xE0n b\u1ED9 \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\xF3 ph\u1EA3i n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\u1ED1i ra \xEDt nh\u1EA5t goalkeeperMinLeadUnits. Hai ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      tools/path_check.py --check thi h\xE0nh; kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xE9o
      \xF4 v\u1EC1 s\xE1t c\u1EA7u m\xF4n ch\u1EC9 v\xEC nh\xECn gi\u1ED1ng v\u1ECB
      tr\xED th\u1EE7 m\xF4n.\",\n  \"_goalkeeperLeadNote\": \"m10 khai 0.6 thay
      v\xEC 1.0 nh\u01B0 c\xE1c map kh\xE1c. L\xFD do \u0111o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c:
      nh\xE1nh tr\xE1i c\xF3 HAI tuy\u1EBFn (O, C) ch\u1EE5m s\xE1t nhau n\xEAn v\xF9ng
      t\u1EA7m Dibu ch\u1EA1m c\u1EA3 hai r\u1EA5t s\u1EDBm, v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng
      1.0 kho\xE1 \xF4 th\u1EE7 m\xF4n \u1EDF y=-6.75 \u2014 CAO h\u01A1n hai \xF4
      s\xE2n f13/f14, t\u1EE9c th\u1EE7 m\xF4n kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0 ch\u1ED1t cu\u1ED1i.
      H\u1EA1 xu\u1ED1ng 0.6 cho Dibu v\u1EC1 y=-7.11 m\xE0 KH\xD4NG m\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9
      ph\u1EE7 (O 2.74\u21922.70, C 2.44\u21922.57): v\xF2ng t\u1EA7m v\u1EABn n\u1EB1m
      tr\u1ECDn tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng, kh\xF4ng tr\xF9m ra sau khung th\xE0nh
      \u2014 \u0111\xF3 m\u1EDBi l\xE0 th\u1EE9 ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng n\xE0y sinh ra \u0111\u1EC3
      ch\u1EB7n.\"\n}\n"
